@ashllll/dsh-open-code-review README · dsh-open-code-review：A [DeepSeek Harness](https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness) plugin that
brings [Alibaba Open Code Review](https://github.com/alibaba/open-code-review)'s
deterministic review engine to DSH agents.

@ashllll/dsh-open-code-review README · Install：Refresh the page and the tools appear as `ocr_review_scope`, `ocr_review_rules`
and `ocr_health`, and the `open-code-review` skill joins the skill catalog. That
is the whole install: **the `ocr` binary arrives with the plugin.**
